# Capability `stock.check`, entered at 300 (its declared entry). The input
# was checked against the declaration's schema by the caller
# (txco://schema/check) before the call; the stack still gates on what it
# needs, as every capability does: the input is untrusted.
WHEN @src == "cap" && @cap.name == "stock.check" && @cap.input.sku =~ /./
  EMIT ._cap.output.in_stock = true,
       ._cap.output.sku = @cap.input.sku
